Enable the repository hooks (no extra packages):

    git config core.hooksPath .githooks

Git then runs .githooks/pre-commit and .githooks/pre-push. Hooks are
bypassable with --no-verify; CI re-runs the same checks on the head SHA.

Local hooks skip the label check when there is no pull request yet, or
when gh is missing. Approval is checked in CI (the trusted guards
workflow). CI fails closed when the required approval is missing.
